<metadata><name>The Dome</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:286-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.707204" lon="-121.326816"><ele>1702.7</ele><name>Ten-Mile Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:paulina-sno-park (OSM way 306294846); confidence: high; pdf_page: 283; book_elev_ft: 5600; quote: map 64: TEN-MILE SNO-PARK 5600'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.712347" lon="-121.277964"><ele>1934.6</ele><name>Paulina Lake outlet (road 21 bridge)</name><desc>source: OSM road 21 node 38373784, as in 283-1; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 283; book_elev_ft: 6331; quote: map 64: Nordic Trail A 3.0 to the resort</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.712302" lon="-121.277653"><ele>1935.2</ele><name>Road 21 east of the outlet bridge</name><desc>source: OSM node 38307726, where Forest Service Road 21 (way 5378046) meets the 2-node unnamed link from the bridge; confidence: high; pdf_page: 283; quote: map 64: road 21 from the resort east</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.717400" lon="-121.200700"><ele>1952.0</ele><name>Hot Springs Campground (on road 21)</name><desc>source: road 21 beside OSM node 3620983697 Hot Springs Campground; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 287; quote: The campground is 4.3 miles from Paulina Lake Resort</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.700430" lon="-121.188380"><ele>2138.6</ele><name>7,000-foot pass on road 21 (China Hat road)</name><desc>source: OSM node 13148244900 on NF 21 way 5373156, road high point by DEM 7016 ft, beside the NF 2127 junction; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 288; book_elev_ft: 7000; quote: turn east onto the China Hat road. Ski uphill 2.4 miles to a 7,000-foot pass</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.696500" lon="-121.184000"><ele>2189.1</ele><name>The Dome, NE rim high point</name><desc>source: DEM high point of the U-shaped rim (7182 ft); OSM The Dome node 357316599 is 0.2 mi SW in the U; top of the OSM Cinder Cone Trail; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 288; book_elev_ft: 7280; quote: climb the steep side of the partially forested cone ... treeless, flat, U-shaped 7,280-foot summit</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>The Dome</name><desc>1. Ten-Mile Sno-Park -&gt; Paulina Lake outlet (road 21 bridge): osm (medium), 2.75 mi | 2. Paulina Lake outlet (road 21 bridge) -&gt; Road 21 east of the outlet bridge: osm (high), 0.02 mi | 3. Road 21 east of the outlet bridge -&gt; Hot Springs Campground (on road 21): osm (high), 4.51 mi | 4. Hot Springs Campground (on road 21) -&gt; 7,000-foot pass on road 21 (China Hat road): osm (medium), 2.69 mi | 5. 7,000-foot pass on road 21 (China Hat road) -&gt; The Dome, NE rim high point: straight (low), 0.35 mi</desc>
